==Battleground==
*1 [[Director Kurosawah]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 66.67~70 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,100f</sup>.
*6 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 50~53.33 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A surprisingly weak Dark stage for how late it appears in a run. Nonetheless, use a couple useful anti-Dark units here and you should pull through.

